<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Battle Mountain EPS view cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Battle Mountain EPS view cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>--EVEREN Securities Inc said Thursday it lowered its 1996 earnings per share estimate on Battle Mountain Gold Co to $0.01 from $0.06 to reflect its expectation of &quot;zero EPS&quot; for the 1996 Q4.</p>
<p>--Analyst Todd Hinrichs in a report said he continues to view the mining company's common stock positively in the long run but neutral in the short run.</p>
<p>--Battle Mountain Gold was trading at 6-5/8, up 1/8.</p>
<p>	     ((Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787))</p>
</text>
